{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/792099-questions-about-the-shadowed-soul-atavism","id":792099,"title":"Questions about the Shadowed Soul Atavism.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-24T04:58:15-08:00","id":792099,"title":"Questions about the Shadowed Soul Atavism.","content":"I was looking at this Atavism and a question occurred to me. When using the normal effect of, can the Beast emerge from the shadow at any point within it? If so, could he set up something to cast a shadow through a window, merge with the shadow and emerge on the other side of the window?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-24T13:19:40-08:00","id":792334,"title":"","content":"Since the satiety expenditure allows the teleport I would say no you can't use the normal function to show up on the other side of a window. As for emerging from points in the shadow I would say its down to reasonable access.<br /> <br /> For example assume the back of a room was dark enough to use shadowed soul. You could use it to emerge from the left, right, or center areas of the shadow without much trouble because it would be reasonable to argue that you were hanging out at some point in the backside of the room and it doesn't step on the abilities of other levels of the same power. You couldn't use it to emerge from the air-vent on the other side of the room through the shadows in the ventilation systems, and you couldn't use it to leave the room beyond being by the side of the room nearest the door.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-24T13:36:11-08:00","id":792344,"title":"","content":"I see what you mean. I just had an idea for an Eshmaki Ravager who feeds by going into places that he physically couldn't go without leaving signs of how he got in, breaking something and leaving the same way without ever picking a lock or breaking a window.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-24T14:30:29-08:00","id":792366,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/792099-questions-about-the-shadowed-soul-atavism?p=792344#post792344\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I see what you mean. I just had an idea for an Eshmaki Ravager who feeds by going into places that he physically couldn't go without leaving signs of how he got in, breaking something and leaving the same way without ever picking a lock or breaking a window.</div> </div> </div> </div>Still possible just more difficult to pull off and might require burning satiety. You might also want to look at infestation as the normal aspect of that allows one to enter through drains or air-ducts and the satiety would let you get in so long as there is any kind of opening at all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-24T14:35:12-08:00","id":792369,"title":"","content":"I see what you mean. Thanks for the advice!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"us